    "section": "Dominatus Event Companion",
    "summary": "In Dominatus Campaign Phases 1 and 2, the winner draws a Battle Honour card. The loser draws a Battle Skill card. For a tie, give both players a Battle Skill draw. If you earned an Agenda Achieved card, add one more draw of the same kind at that time. Choose one to retain and put the second card back into its deck.",
